title: Slavic Minorities: Autonomy
subtitle: The programme of PPS for the Ukrainian and Belarusian question.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/map_2.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'slavic_autonomy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.slavic_autonomy (catalogue 4.6; technical reference 10.8): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. The present line is shown and cannot be
// chosen again; closing the card is free (Z — 0.32).
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'slavic_autonomy');
!}

= Slavic Minorities: Autonomy

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @federation
- @regional_autonomy
- @cultural_rights
- @polonisation
- @easy_discard

@federation
title: Federation
subtitle: The programme of a federal state; axis +2. Only compatible steps can be carried out in this chapter.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'slavic_autonomy', 'federation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_federation_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'slavic_autonomy', 'federation');
!}
go-to: result

@regional_autonomy
title: Autonomy of the voivodeships
subtitle: A unitary state with devolved powers; axis +1.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'slavic_autonomy', 'regional_autonomy').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_regional_autonomy_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'slavic_autonomy', 'regional_autonomy');
!}
go-to: result

@cultural_rights
title: Freedom of language, schools and organisations without autonomy
subtitle: Axis 0.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'slavic_autonomy', 'cultural_rights').available !}
